      dealing: "To determine the first Hâkem, deal cards face-up one at a time anticlockwise until someone receives an Ace — they become Hâkem. For play: the player to Hâkem's right deals. First deal 5 cards to each player. Hâkem looks at 5 cards and declares trump. Then deal remaining 8 cards to each player (13 total).",
